        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the ambitions of a bald office worker determined to reach the top of the company — literally and figuratively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a physics-based solo action game where you use a fire extinguisher as a propulsion device to launch yourself across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your balance, adjust your center of gravity, and control your momentum to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use directional spraying to move, jump, and glide through each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your body balanced — tipping over means losing control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new obstacles, slopes, gaps, and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts or safer routes depending on your skill level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement that rewards practice and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with increasingly challenging maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retry instantly for fast-paced attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light theme with a charming (and bald) main character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players can complete the game in 1~2 hours(or more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievers can spend longer mastering balance techniques and speedrunning stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the corporate ladder your own way — one fire extinguisher blast at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the ambitions of a bald office worker determined to reach the top of the company — literally and figuratively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a physics-based solo action game where you use a fire extinguisher as a propulsion device to launch yourself across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your balance, adjust your center of gravity, and control your momentum to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use directional spraying to move, jump, and glide through each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your body balanced — tipping over means losing control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new obstacles, slopes, gaps, and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts or safer routes depending on your skill level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement that rewards practice and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with increasingly challenging maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retry instantly for fast-paced attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light theme with a charming (and bald) main character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players can complete the game in 1~2 hours(or more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievers can spend longer mastering balance techniques and speedrunning stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the corporate ladder your own way — one fire extinguisher blast at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
